{
  // BRASS HOUR - classic hard rock.
  //
  // Mixolydian rather than minor: the major third with a flattened seventh is
  // the sound of most rock that predates metal, and it is what stops this
  // reading as a slower version of the thrash preset.
  //
  // This one exists to show the lead and support handover. The piano leads the
  // verses while the guitar sits behind on muted accents; the guitar takes the
  // choruses and the piano drops to open chords under it. Two instruments both
  // playing flat out is what that logic is there to prevent, and the difference
  // is audible if you listen to a verse and a chorus back to back.

